  "result": "Excellent! All tests pass. I've added the `vatSummary` function to `src/reports.js` with comprehensive tests.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded `vatSummary(invoices)` to `src/reports.js` that:\n- Filters invoices with status `'issued'`, `'partially_paid'`, or `'paid'`\n- Groups by VAT rate and calculates:\n  - `base`: sum of line amounts after discounts (rounded to cents)\n  - `vat`: sum of VAT calculated per line (rounded at line level, then summed)\n- Returns array of `{ rate, base, vat }` objects\n- Sorts by rate descending (high to low: 21%, 9%, 0%)\n\nAdded 22 tests in `test/reports.test.js` covering:\n- Null/empty input handling\n- Status filtering (includes issued/partially_paid/paid, excludes draft)\n- Single and multiple VAT rates\n- Discount calculations (explicit line discounts and tier discounts)\n- Multiple invoices aggregation\n- Payment status independence\n- Edge cases and large datasets\n\nAll 292 project tests pass.",
